stag deer large~
the stag~
This large male deer watches you closely from the trees.
~
This must be the leader of the herd, for this stag is quite large.  He has to
be careful not to get his large rack of antlers stuck in the lower branches of
the trees.  He watches you closely, ready to protect the herd if it comes to
that.
~
