#4037
In The Pine Grove~
You wander amongst the pine trees of the grove.  Although the growth is thick,
there is enough room to comfortable walk among the sweet-smelling trees.
Despite the many branches entwined above you, light still flows down, giving
the whole area a safe feeling.  Various woodland creatures walk about,
ignoring your presence.
~
